      axis, ignoring NaNs.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.nanprod`: Compute the product of array elements along a
      given axis, ignoring NaNs.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.nanmean`: Compute the mean of array elements along a given
      axis, ignoring NaNs.

